-- O Chefe (owner, 14/11): large dogs stand behind a solid desk that hides their hind legs, like the owner's example.
update public.personalities set image_prompt = 'Dress the pet as a modern, stylish young CEO: a sleek, perfectly tailored slim-fit suit jacket in deep emerald green, a crisp white shirt with an open collar (no tie), a silk pocket square and a smart watch on one front paw; no trousers. It sits upright on its haunches on a big minimalist white desk, like a real animal, looking straight at the camera with a confident, bossy look, both front paws resting on the desk, one of them placed on a neatly coiled colourful dog lead (leash) as if to say it is time to go. If the pet is a large dog, it stands tall instead, right behind a wide solid desk with a closed front panel down to the floor, so only its chest, front legs and head show above the desk and its hind legs are completely hidden behind it; its long neck and big chest are well above the desk and both front paws rest on the desk, one on the lead. Cats and small or medium dogs sit on the desk as described. A sleek laptop beside it. A bright, modern glass-walled office high above the city, plants and designer furniture. No people, no readable text.'
where id in ('pt-chefe', 'en-chefe', 'es-chefe', 'fr-chefe');
